  #line-at(313.25pt, 542.23pt, "with mirror and angled waveguides but excludes the fiber self-")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 554.35pt, "aligning sockets. A cyclical pattern of loss in the data follows ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 566.35pt, "a near-periodic variance in guiding layer depths (4 layers) and ")
